<title>UK: Carlsberg-Tetley briefs workforce.</title>
<headline>Carlsberg-Tetley briefs workforce.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brewer Carlsberg-Tetley said on Monday executives were briefing its 4,000 strong workforce after the British government announced on Friday it was blocking a plan to merge with Bass Plc.</p>
<p>&quot;Employees will be briefed today and that will include an announcement that the executive board will be doing a general review of the business in the light of the decision that Margaret Beckett (Britain's trade and industry secretary) made,&quot; said John Haywood, Carlsberg's manager of corporate public relations.</p>
</text>
